(1. Architecture Summary) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 720 Tm
(Edgecipline is a multi-platform SaaS product for retail traders. It combines an) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 706 Tm
(AI-assisted trade journal, screenshot-to-trade extraction, performance analytics,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 692 Tm
(discipline tracking, psychology insights, weekly reports, subscriptions, notifications,) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 678 Tm
(and an internal admin console.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 664 Tm
(The recommended architecture is a modular full-stack SaaS:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 650 Tm
(- Static-export Next.js frontend for web and mobile shell delivery.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 636 Tm
(- Capacitor Android wrapper for mobile distribution.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 622 Tm
(- Node.js/Express API for business logic and integrations.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 608 Tm
(- MongoDB for flexible product data and analytics-friendly document storage.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 594 Tm
(- Redis + BullMQ for asynchronous OCR/AI processing.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 580 Tm
(- Cloudinary for uploaded screenshot storage.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 566 Tm
(- Google Vision / Tesseract / Gemini for OCR and AI extraction.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 552 Tm
(- Firebase Authentication for Google sign-in and mobile-friendly auth.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 538 Tm
(- JWT + rotating refresh tokens for backend sessions.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 524 Tm
(- Razorpay for India-first subscription payments.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 510 Tm
(- Sentry + Winston logs for production observability.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 496 Tm
(At scale, the system should be deployed as three independently scalable runtime units:) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 482 Tm
(1. Frontend static app served by CDN.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 468 Tm
(2. API server handling auth, CRUD, analytics, payments, admin, and orchestration.) Tj
/FR 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 454 Tm
(3. OCR worker fleet processing image extraction jobs from Redis/BullMQ.) Tj
/FR 8 Tf
1 0 0 1 62 34 Tm
(Edgecipline Architecture | 3) Tj
ET
endstream
